=== Zadanie 3b: klucz CA 4096 bit zaszyfrowany 3DES ===
$ openssl genrsa -out private/cakey.pem 4096
$ openssl rsa -in private/cakey.pem -out private/cakey.enc -outform PEM -des3 -passout env:CA_PASS
writing RSA key
-----BEGIN ENCRYPTED PRIVATE KEY-----

=== Zadanie 3c: autocertyfikat CA na dwa lata ===
$ openssl req -new -x509 -batch -days 730 -passin env:CA_PASS -key private/cakey.pem -out cacert.pem -subj /C=PL/ST=mazowieckie/L=Siedlce/O=UwS/OU=Instytut Informatyki/CN=moje_ca/emailAddress=ca@example.com
subject=C=PL, ST=mazowieckie, L=Siedlce, O=UwS, OU=Instytut Informatyki, CN=moje_ca, emailAddress=ca@example.com
issuer=C=PL, ST=mazowieckie, L=Siedlce, O=UwS, OU=Instytut Informatyki, CN=moje_ca, emailAddress=ca@example.com
notBefore=Oct  7 14:41:58 2026 GMT
notAfter=Oct  6 14:41:58 2028 GMT

